---
description: Session Agent and passage generation (W2).
globs: services/session_agent/**,services/core/generator/**,services/core/books/**
alwaysApply: false
---

See `services/session_agent/AGENTS.md` and `services/core/AGENTS.md`.
- The state machine is a pure function and decides every prompt; keep it at 100% line coverage.
- "That word is X." is always a clip, never Gemini Live. `VOICE_MODE`/`SESSION_PROFILE` come from server env only.
- The child's own words never reach the generator; only taxonomy tags and a safe detail do.
- Prompt/model changes: rerun the eval set (use `alo-prompt-eval`).
